{
  "about": "Game Settings' Extras > UI scale and its size, in a 1440x900 window. Off (as the game is), the canvas is the window's own 1440x900 and the HUD keeps its size. On, at the classic size, the canvas is 768 rows (1228x768): the basic info, the hotkeys, the chat, the minimap, the windows and their text all come out 900/768 bigger, and the world's view stays as it was. The UI size row's left arrow makes it smaller: \"As at 1152x864\" is an 864-row canvas (1382x864), \"As at 1280x960\" asks for more rows than the window has, so the canvas is the window's again; the right arrow goes back up and stops at the classic size. Everything still takes its clicks where it's drawn: Game Settings, which stays under the pointer as the canvas changes (a tab, the arrows, its Close button), the game menu's Return, the inventory dragged by its title bar, and a ground cell the character then walks to. Off again, the canvas is the window's again. Main has the switch but no size row.",
  "account": "",
  "slot": 0,
  "env": {"RUSTNAROK_CLIENT_WINDOW": "1440x900"},
  "steps": [
    {"say": "@warp morocc 160 120"},
    {"settle": 1500},
    {"say": "@heal"},
    {"key": "Escape"},
    {"wait": 300},
    {"click_on": {"button": "settings"}},
    {"wait": 300},
    {"click_on": {"button": "settings_tab:5"}},
    {"wait": 200},
    {"key": "Alt+E"},
    {"wait": 300},
    {"expect": {"windows_open": ["GameSettings", "Inventory"], "state": {"settings.tab": 5, "settings.ui_scale": false, "settings.canvas": [1440.0, 900.0]}}},
    {"move": [1000, 750]},
    {"wait": 200},
    {"shot": "ui-scale-off", "threshold": 5},
    {"click_on": {"button": "switch:7"}, "hit": "GameSettings"},
    {"wait": 500},
    {"expect": {"windows_open": ["GameSettings", "Inventory"], "state": {"settings.ui_scale": true, "settings.canvas": [1228.0, 768.0]}}},
    {"click_on": {"button": "settings_tab:0"}, "hit": "GameSettings"},
    {"wait": 200},
    {"expect": {"state": {"settings.tab": 0}}},
    {"click_on": {"button": "settings_tab:5"}, "hit": "GameSettings"},
    {"wait": 200},
    {"expect": {"state": {"settings.tab": 5}}},
    {"move": [1000, 700]},
    {"wait": 200},
    {"shot": "ui-scale-on", "threshold": 5},
    {"click_on": {"button": "ui_size_less"}, "hit": "GameSettings"},
    {"wait": 500},
    {"expect": {"windows_open": ["GameSettings", "Inventory"], "state": {"settings.ui_scale": true, "settings.ui_size": 864, "settings.canvas": [1382.0, 864.0]}}},
    {"move": [1100, 800]},
    {"wait": 200},
    {"shot": "ui-size-864", "threshold": 5},
    {"click_on": {"button": "ui_size_less"}, "hit": "GameSettings"},
    {"wait": 500},
    {"expect": {"state": {"settings.ui_size": 960, "settings.canvas": [1440.0, 900.0]}}},
    {"click_on": {"button": "ui_size_more"}, "hit": "GameSettings"},
    {"wait": 500},
    {"click_on": {"button": "ui_size_more"}, "hit": "GameSettings"},
    {"wait": 500},
    {"click_on": {"button": "ui_size_more"}, "hit": "GameSettings"},
    {"wait": 500},
    {"expect": {"state": {"settings.ui_size": 768, "settings.canvas": [1228.0, 768.0]}}},
    {"click_on": {"button": "settings_close"}, "hit": "GameSettings"},
    {"wait": 300},
    {"click_on": {"button": "return"}, "hit": "GameMenu"},
    {"wait": 300},
    {"expect": {"windows_closed": ["GameSettings", "GameMenu"], "windows_open": ["Inventory"]}},
    {"click": [150, 500], "hit": null},
    {"wait": 700},
    {"drag": [[120, 128], [220, 428]]},
    {"wait": 700},
    {"click": [150, 500], "hit": "Inventory"},
    {"wait": 700},
    {"click": [120, 250], "hit": null},
    {"wait": 700},
    {"say": "@warp morocc 160 120"},
    {"settle": 1500},
    {"click_on": {"cell": [164, 121]}},
    {"wait": 2500},
    {"expect": {"state": {"player.cell": [164, 121]}}},
    {"move": [1000, 700]},
    {"wait": 200},
    {"shot": "ui-scale-on-hud", "threshold": 5},
    {"key": "Alt+E"},
    {"wait": 300},
    {"key": "Escape"},
    {"wait": 300},
    {"click_on": {"button": "settings"}},
    {"wait": 300},
    {"click_on": {"button": "settings_tab:5"}},
    {"wait": 200},
    {"click_on": {"button": "switch:7"}, "hit": "GameSettings"},
    {"wait": 500},
    {"expect": {"state": {"settings.ui_scale": false, "settings.canvas": [1440.0, 900.0]}}},
    {"click_on": {"button": "settings_close"}, "hit": "GameSettings"},
    {"wait": 300},
    {"click_on": {"button": "return"}, "hit": "GameMenu"},
    {"wait": 300},
    {"expect": {"windows_closed": ["GameSettings", "GameMenu"]}}
  ]
